{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38526","headline":"宪丞裴公上洛退居有寄二首 一 · 吴融","name":"宪丞裴公上洛退居有寄二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸿在冥冥已自由，紫芝峰下更高秋。\n抛来簪绂都如梦，泥着杯香不爲愁。\n晚树拂檐风脱翠，夜滩当户月和流。\n自嗟不得从公去，共上仙家十二楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38526.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38526","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}